s://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831393_3143141469410480_8992390881307031227_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CtTtVt3JpGYQ7kNvwFG-MHX&_nc_oc=AdpIDgEjK1i_wecfdsaPBfQROj9qJnnbQpZ8nl8dkUUPceUQaH65QGdChbNOic1yZOE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ_xdgT5LqeMNHAEr5HGZ2Fws2XcfPrTmywVJroeTavCQ&oe=6AFC80AF"}, {"file_name": "Starting5.png", "id": "1599240338607478", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673658581_1599240341940811_6446936826907626816_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JAMCzvr2YGQQ7kNvwGIKMR7&_nc_oc=AdruFIt4RZiCWLhdgD5ZPePvafe--jrOSyIrcf_khnK9Pq85uk-XBamEh_tgqpsWd1g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ0xwNT52G67-Qng7n2Z49zFwmsTZZd55NWqZ4a9cp-YA&oe=6AFC7515"}, {"file_name": "Starting4.png", "id": "2236726573562409", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604375581_2236726576895742_8534051560980313027_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=F0BtzNfr4Y0Q7kNvwFLMuhN&_nc_oc=AdoP_t4kqFS2str2E9eOAv1hd5LeVsLRRqEvPiuLgJPjyq3E2RL9SJgQJnSRYB3q97Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT9I65KHS27vA6Ckx0cq-e6tuQciptOjKQFAupU6YE9Jg&oe=6AFC5F63"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Teach My Little Sister How To Drive Taxi", "keywords": ["taxi", "drive", "sister", "teach", "simulator"], "long_description": "Teach My Little Sister How To Drive Taxi \ud83d\ude95\n\nYou're a taxi driver. You're also a driving instructor. Unfortunately, your student is your little sister. What could possibly go wrong?\n\nWelcome to Teach My Little Sister How To Drive Taxi, a hilarious driving simulator where your mission is simple: teach your little sister how to become the best taxi driver in town!\n\nThere's just one tiny problem... she's watching EVERYTHING you do.\n\nEvery turn, every traffic light, every questionable parking decision, and every unfortunate accident could become part of her driving education.\n\n\ud83d\ude95 Be the Best (or Worst) Driving Instructor!\n\nGet behind the wheel of your taxi and show your little sister how it's done! Pick up passengers, navigate busy streets, and demonstrate your incredible driving skills.\n\nOr don't. We're not here to judge.\n\n\ud83d\udea6 Your Driving, Your Lessons!\n\nYour little sister looks up to you and trusts you to teach her everything about driving. Will you show her how to respect traffic laws, drive responsibly, and keep passengers safe?\n\nOr will you accidentally teach her that sidewalks are shortcuts and red lights are just suggestions?\n\n\ud83d\ude02 A Driving Lesson You'll Never Forget!\n\n- Teach Your Little Sister: She's watching you drive, so make every lesson count!\n- Become a Taxi Driver: Pick up passengers and take them to their destinations.\n- Drive Your Way: Follow the traffic rules or become the reason they exist.\n- Cause Hilarious Chaos: Sometimes the best driving lessons", "short_description": "Teach your little sister how to drive taxi! \ud83d\ude95 She's watching your every move, so drive carefully, pick up passengers, follow the rules, and try not to teach her the worst driving habits imaginable. Then, yell at her to see if she can do the same! \n\nWhat could possibly go wrong? Teach your little sister how to drive taxi! Pick up strangers on taxi, show her how it's done. Can you do be both the taxi and the instructor? "}]}, "developer_name": "MB Game Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mbgamestudio.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "MB Game Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://mbgamestudio.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "33152918